 ['Gonzalez 2018 [@gonzalez2018]','Pediatric Health Information System, 4,459 neonates','Early (day 1) against delayed closure','Delayed closure went with longer stay and more parenteral nutrition days, also without complicated cases. Hospitals varied widely.','Adjusted regression, timing not technique'],
